ou are a rookie Agent assigned to dismantle a crime ring in a small rural town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore town, make friends, and <strong>Catch the Scum Lord</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/0c689f99d6bd60fd45e3a4ad05cee9dd.avif?t=1770415852\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras_big/0c689f99d6bd60fd45e3a4ad05cee9dd.avif?t=1770415852 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Tight Controls</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple enough to <strong>Pick Up &amp; Play</strong>.\u00a0 Deep enough to reward skilled maneuvers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/98d5c2086d447752f4f030bc21b0199a.poster.avif?t=1770415852\" width=668 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/98d5c2086d447752f4f030bc21b0199a.webm?t=1770415852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/98d5c2086d447752f4f030bc21b0199a.mp4?t=1770415852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 retro concept cars, each with\u00a0<strong>Distinct feel</strong> and stats<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/8644666203ca876d013b3370e8b26376.avif?t=1770415852\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras_big/8644666203ca876d013b3370e8b26376.avif?t=1770415852 width=800 height=118 /></span></p><h2 